FYI, see below. Sent from my phone so short.

---------- Forwarded message ---------
From: Hal Example <hal@example.com>
Date: Fri, Nov 6, 2026 at 8:00 AM
Subject: Office closed Monday
To: team@example.com

The office is closed on Monday for maintenance.
Work from home if you can.
